  "title": "Green Bean Fries with Spicy Mayo",
  "description": "Coated with a tasty panko-Parmesan crust, these crisp-tender green bean &#34;fries&#34; are served with a spicy Sriracha mayo for dipping.",
  "authors": [
    "Nicole McLaughlin"
